rshall-Miller","Darrion Scoggins","Alexandre Chen","Damian Cecere","Brenda Ballard","Gary Ballard","Marie Del Marco","Karen Teliha","Armando Molina","Gabe Eggerling","Heidi Fecht","Beth Triffon","Anthony Keyvan","Keeshan Giles","Tyler Clark","Stephanie Jackson","Dave Theune","Cornelius Peter","Markus Silbiger","Kevin Thomas Mitchell","Alfred Adderly","Isabella Revel","Ross Ryman","Reece Caddell","Alice L. Walker","Heath Gfeller","Johnny Meyer","Justin Dray","Johnnie Ladd","Gemma Brooke Allen","Jeff Holman","Bruce M. Stockert","Ben Zelevansky","Andrea M. Anderson","Bob Glouberman","Louise Claps","Cooper North","Everleigh McDonell","Serenity Grace Russell","Melissa Bickerton","Cheryl Francis Harrington","Paras Patel","Gabby Sanalitro","Hina Abdullah","Daniel Edward Mora","Ed Lover","Gary Kraus","Bria Danielle Singleton","Kimberly Crandall","Kristi Yamaguchi","Ajgie Kirkland","Todd James Jackson","Pat Sajak","West Mulholland","Nina Millin","Boce Robinson Mitchell","Griffin Kunitz","Susan Boyajian","Diego Alexander","Julia Garcia","Hilda Boulware","Ashley Ray Keefe","Lynette DuPree","Natalie Coughlin","Mia Kaplan","Biff Wiff","Roam Diesel","June Angela","Meera Simhan","Stephen Oyoung","George Paez","Treisa Gary","Chen Tang","Justice Griffin","Becky Feldman","Mustafa Speaks","D.K. Uzoukwu","Yolanda Snowball","Evelyn Kim","Dylan Henry Lau","Paul Kwo","Landall Goolsby","Rashmi Rustagi","Ruby Marino","Corey Mendell Parker","Grace Wethor","Lauren Cook","Kurtis Bedford","A.J. Tannen","Wendy Rosoff"],"screenwriters":["Ali Wong","Erica Oyama","Nahnatchka Khan","Matt Kuhn","Amelie Gillette","David Smithyman","Keith Heisler","Jeff Chiang","Eric Ziobrowski","Rachna Fruchbom","Rich Blomquist","Kourtney Kang","Camilla Blackett","Emily Cutler","Cory Caplan","Aaron Ho","Samantha Riley","Kyle Lau","Sheng Wang","Cindy Fang","Teresa Hsiao","Laura McCreary","Talia Bernstein","Ria Sardana","Jeff Chlebus","Abbey Caldwell","Sanjay Shah"],"cinematographers":["Uta Briesewitz","Greg Matthews","Brandon Mastrippolito"],"composers":["Craig Wedren","Bo Boddie"],"reviews":[{"author":"tehol","text":"Dle mě zde velmi podhodnoceny a opomijeny serial. Zacnu tim, ze dabing se tady dost povedl, uprimne se mi snad Jessica libi vic, nez v originale. Kde ale vidim vyrazny naskok oproti ostatnim sitcomum, jsou detske postavy. A ted nemyslim jen hlavni tri, ale predevsim ty ve vedlejsich rolich. ja obecne vetsinou deti v tv nesnasim, ale tady se tvurcum opravdu podarilo vytvorit velmi vtipnou a zajimavou skupinu.                                                                                                                                                         Dale si rozhodne nemyslim, ze je to sitcom ve stylu prumernych the middle, fresh off the boat jde mnohem dal ve vsech ohledech a je mnohem odvaznejsi, treba ruzne flashbackove sceny jsou vyborne. Kdyz uz s necim srovnavat tak s modern family.                                                                                                                                                                                                                           Domenou nicmene jsou jako u kazdeho sitcomu hlavni postavy. A tady se to hodne povedlo. Jessica mi prijde jako takovy zensky, nadherny, cinsky sheldon, coz mozna zni trochu uchylne ale je to hodne sexy. A louis rozhodne nei zadny suchar, jak tu nekdo pise, naopak je to phildunphy-style hrdina a to ja adoruju.(10.04.2017)","stars":5},{"author":"kareen","text":"Obvykle rodinné sitcomy, kde se objevují děti, moc nemusím, ale tady jsou děcka docela fajn a občas i přispějou k nějaké legraci. Je to osvěžující podívat se na USA z pohledu praštěné americko-čínské rodinky. Hlavním tahounem je tu tvrdá a nekompromisní, přesto pohledná matka, která se s ničím nepáře, nějaká politická, rasová i jiná korektnost je jí cizí, a je většinou zdrojem těch nejvtipnějších situací. Není to sice seriál, kde bych se lámala smíchy, ale vtipné je to dost.(08.09.2019)","stars":4},{"author":"Hon2ar","text":"Báječná létapřišla do současnosti a přišla z východní Asie. Příhody malé asijské rodinky nejsou strhující zábavou k popukání, jedná se ale o milý sitcom, kde se člověk usmívá, tak hodně, až je to příjemné. Navíc Randall Park a Constance Wu zvládají své role rodičů naprosto s přehledem. A Wu je navíc sakra pohledná asijská Marge Simpsonová.(22.06.2015)","stars":4}],"vods":[{"platform":"Disney+","url":"https://srv.tunefindforfans.com/showads/track/srvclk.php?aid=100006796&lp=https%3A//www.disneyplus.com/en-cz/browse/entity-b3bab1c6-c54b-4564-bf9d-badc7aa16094"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/395491-huangovi-v-americe/prehled/","csfd_id":395491,"root_id":395491,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":6,"episode_count":116,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null,"episodes":[]}